
flowchart TD
    A[Input: Four Iris Features] --> B[StandardScaler]
    B --> C[Scaled Feature Vector]
    C --> D[Multiclass Logistic Regression]
    D --> E[Calculate Class Scores]
    E --> F[Apply Softmax Function]
    F --> G[Setosa Probability]
    F --> H[Versicolor Probability]
    F --> I[Virginica Probability]
    G --> J[Probability Distribution]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K[Select Highest Probability]
    K --> L[Predicted Iris Species]
